 Global keys
  1-8                    switch tabs: Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages, Tools,
                         Settings, Inbox, Delivery
  enter                  go into the selected thing
  arrows, j/k            move
  esc                    back; first clears a filter you typed
  /                      filter or search
  ctrl+p                 find a session by name, project, folder, machine or
                         task
  R                      refresh
  c                      open the Atlas session
  C                      focus the Atlas box
  ?                      help
  q, ctrl+c              quit

 Sessions
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end            first, last row
  enter                  open the selected session; details show trust, request
                         rule and delegation policy
  m                      send a message to the session as yourself
  n                      start a session in herdr: project, harness, model,
                         folder and first message (a form)
  x                      stop or remove the selected session
  X                      remove all offline sessions shown
  h                      hide or unhide the selected session
  left, right            move between session actions
  space                  cycle the request rule: normal, ask, auto
  z                      collapse or expand the selected tree; on a child, act
                         on its lead
  Z                      collapse or expand all session trees
  v                      cycle the view: active (default) or all, which includes
                         offline sessions
  H                      show or hide sessions hidden with h, and temp-folder
                         sessions in the all view
  a                      in the offline view, preview and archive offline
                         sessions, or show archived and restore
  p                      pin or unpin the selected session so it stays visible
                         in Idle
  d                      show or hide the selected session details
  ◐                      runs in the background: no terminal is attached
  ★                      repo or team lead; dim when no lead session is live

 Graph
  D                      delivery
  d                      show or hide dormant nodes
  f                      focus on a node and its neighbours, or zoom into a team
  esc                    go back one focus or team level
  x                      archive the selected dormant repo and tombstone its
                         agent after confirmation
  X                      on the dormant chip, confirm removal of every dormant
                         node
  /                      find a node; enter selects the first match
  +, =                   zoom in
  -                      zoom out
  shift+arrows           pan
  , .                    select a linked neighbour
  n                      start a session in this project
  enter                  open the selected agent card
  m                      toggle all message and owner lines
  t                      show all nodes, then each active team in turn
  T                      create, rename, fill or archive a team
  e                      charter
  E                      global charter

 Graph find
  enter                  select the first match
  backspace, ctrl+h      delete

 Agent card
  e                      charter
  E                      global charter
  enter                  open Sessions filtered to this agent's project
  n                      start a new session in this project (the same form,
                         filled from here)
  t                      open Tools filtered to this node
  a                      toggle autonomy off or wake (wakes on messages)
  D                      name this project
  u                      undo the selected one (a learned change)
  , .                    select a previous or next learned change or charter
                         draft
  y                      accept the selected charter draft (drafted from
                         AGENTS.md)
  x                      reject the selected charter draft
  l                      choose or clear the repo lead
  h                      hide or unhide this project
  H                      show hidden projects
  ctrl+u/d, pgup/pgdn    scroll the card: charter, rules and learned changes

  live state             needs you: highlighted; busy: bright; idle: normal;
                         offline: dim
  ★                      team lead; each box lists the team members
  dormant                no online session or activity in 30 days, archived, or
                         a temporary name
Legend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Edges
  ──▶ depends  consumer uses provider
  ──▶ deploys  deployer runs the app's deploys
  Request rule on an edge from A to B
  normal  delivered; B judges it
  auto    delivered with a trust note; B can act without asking you, still
          inside B's merge authority and refusals
  ask     held in the Inbox
  never   refused
  a specific edge beats the all projects wildcard; an edge never grants deploy
  or merge permission by itself (deploy_rule and merge_authority do)
  Charter fields
  maturity         sets the default rules; the only charter field with an
                   enforced effect
  accepts          your agent reads it every turn; every neighbour reads the
                   first 40 characters
  refuses          same as accepts
  escalate         your agent reads it every turn
  purpose          in a worker's brief
  maturity_note    explains the repo enum
  rules            free text at every level; read by agents
  sources          the level and scope of each effective field
  feature_requests shown only when another agent looks this node up

 Quotas
  tab, shift+tab         Quotas / Workers log / Quality
  p                      protect or unprotect this subscription
  f                      set worker quota floor (0-95%)
  s                      show or hide subscriptions that are not set up

 Workers log
  tab, shift+tab         sub tab
  pgup                   page up
  pgdown                 page down

 Messages
  left/right             select the previous or next message
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end            first thread, latest message
  enter                  open the selected message body
  f                      report a defect found later on the selected worker
                         conversation
  l                      filter
  m                      send a message to the session as yourself
  x                      stop the selected worker or session
  d                      show or hide details
  states               pending ... delivered ✓ replied ↩ failed ✗

