  r                      decline
  A                      approve all

 Delivery
  pgup                   ten changes up
  pgdown                 ten changes down
  a                      show all
  y                      on a To try row, report that the check passed: the
                         owner tried it and it works
  n                      on a To try row, report that the check failed: type one
                         line of what is wrong

